    {
      "id": "9b8287d7-ac82-4c77-b0be-cda9267e7311",
      "parent_id": null,
      "icon": "bxs-brain",
      "ai_summary": "- Serves as the landing page and root entry point for the demo vault\n- Explains the two-phase trial design and instructions for the AI agent\n- Directs users to execute the pre-recorded task to unlock personal sandbox access",
      "summary_is_current": true,
      "title": "Welcome to the Demo",
      "content": "# Welcome to the Nexidion Demo\nThis is a live demo of Nexidion. Right now, you are in Phase 1, where editing and file creation are disabled.\n\n## To experience Nexidion's AI agent:\n1. Look at the right-hand panel (when you are on mobile, click the Context Tab in the header first). You will see a pre-configured, pre-recorded AI Task queued up.\n2. Click **\"Queue Task\"**.\n3. Watch the agent process our unstructured notes in real-time.\n\nOnce the agent finishes organizing this vault, it will automatically update this welcome page, unlock your access, and transition you into a **personal sandbox mode** where you can create, edit, and experiment.",
      "created_at": "2026-05-24T19:36:03+00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-05-24T19:36:03+00:00Z",
      "versions": [
        {
          "version": 1,
          "title": "Welcome to the Demo",
          "content": "# Welcome to the Nexidion Demo\nThis is a live demo of Nexidion. Right now, you are in Phase 1, where editing and file creation are disabled.\n\n## To experience Nexidion's AI agent:\n1. Look at the right-hand panel (when you are on mobile, click the Context Tab in the header first). You will see a pre-configured, pre-recorded AI Task queued up.\n2. Click **\"Queue Task\"**.\n3. Watch the agent process our unstructured notes in real-time.\n\nOnce the agent finishes organizing this vault, it will automatically update this welcome page, unlock your access, and transition you into a **personal sandbox mode** where you can create, edit, and experiment.",
          "created_at": "2026-05-24T19:36:03+00:00Z",
          "author_display_name": "Admin"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e7c3f9f1-41ad-47bc-a732-f99a8fa353a1",
