      "icon": "bxs-no-entry",
      "ai_summary": "- Contains highly sensitive credentials, signatures, and private API keys\n- Acts as a security boundary demonstration for locked nodes in Nexidion\n- Physically isolates content from AI read/write tools at the database layer",
      "summary_is_current": true,
      "title": "Team Directory & Private Keys",
      "content": "# [ACCESS RESTRICTED - NODE LOCKED]\nThis node contains private developer signatures, personal email directories, and development API endpoints. \n*Note for Demo Users:* Because this node is locked, Nexidion's AI agent is physically barred from indexing or reading its contents during the task execution. The agent can still read the title and move the node around.",
      "created_at": "2026-05-24T19:38:46+00:00Z",
